Ideas, no code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These projects inspired parts of the design. Nothing was copied from them.

- bjarneo/cliamp (MIT): a headless daemon controlled by `needle next`,
  `needle status` and similar subcommands; an inline status line.
- clangen/musikcube (BSD 3-Clause): browsing the library by artist, album
  and genre in columns; a playback core kept apart from its frontends.
- sammwyy/listnr (no licence): a SQLite cache of tags with `index` and
  `list --search` commands; `--raw` and `--headless` JSON-lines modes;
  cover art through Kitty, iTerm2 or Sixel with a half-block fallback.
- TrevorSatori/kronos (GPL-3.0): theme colours set in config.toml.
- potomak/haskell-player (BSD 3-Clause): playing through macOS's afplay and
  afinfo; ~/Music as the default library.
- Ay-can/kanyey (no licence): a Ye quote when the terminal opens.

Demo media
- The artists, albums, tracks and cover gradients in docs/ are made up and
  were generated for the screenshots (silent audio, ffmpeg gradients).
